        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Aquarius &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>Dégel's defensive art &mdash; a wall of absolute cold that stops what is thrown at it.</em></p><p>A dome of frozen air with a 20-foot radius forms centred on you and lasts 1 minute.</p><p>You and your allies inside gain <strong>cold resistance 15</strong> and a <strong>+2 circumstance bonus to AC against ranged attacks</strong>.</p><p>Any creature hostile to you that enters the dome or ends its turn inside takes @Damage[6d8[cold]] damage with a basic Fortitude save, and is slowed 1 on a failure.</p><p>Ranged attacks and spell attacks crossing into the dome from outside take a <strong>&minus;4 circumstance penalty</strong>.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8, the resistance by 5, and the radius by 5 feet.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
        },
